  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a Path to Education for At-Risk Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MindLeaps transitions at-risk children to stable lives in school and the workplace through programs in Africa, the US and the Balkans. This begins with our dance program, engaging kids in fun classes based on a methodology crafted to develop cognitive and social-emotional skills vital to success. With our ongoing support, children are sponsored in formal education. MindLeaps also strengthens the family unit through small business investments and access to computer training and technology.</narrative>
  </description>
